        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMPORTANT: <i>This is a party racing game, but without active driving. Each pilot configures their race vehicle once, but doesn't control it during the race. A party is about spending time with friends, not getting lost in a screen. Our game enhances the fun—it doesn’t steal it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IT'S EARLY ACCESS, SO THE GAME IS IN EARLY STAGE OF DEVELOPMENT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLEASE PLAY FREE VERSION (MAJOR PARTY RACING CORE) and pay only if you want to support the development. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five pilots, idle/lazy gameplay, a fresh take on the genre! Before playing, grab some paper cards and a marker, pen, or pencil—it’s part of the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/3c98f70f10394488ddf887cb240ea89f.poster.avif?t=1754036686\" width=700 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/3c98f70f10394488ddf887cb240ea89f.webm?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/3c98f70f10394488ddf887cb240ea89f.mp4?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How It Works:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a party-packed racing experience! You and your friends split into <strong>two squads</strong>—racers and support teams. But here's the twist: support teams aren’t locked to a specific driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Racers</strong> customize their vehicles and fine-tune their driving style. <br>🎲 <strong>Support teams</strong> strategize—who’s their pick, and what’s the next big vibe for the party. They place their <strong>big goal</strong> on the chosen driver—what happens if their pilot wins. Someone’s eyeing pizza, another’s calling for the jacuzzi, maybe a dance-off, or even a hilarious video challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/dab50cef737efc853ef3b8295b839c76.poster.avif?t=1754036686\" width=544 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/dab50cef737efc853ef3b8295b839c76.webm?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/dab50cef737efc853ef3b8295b839c76.mp4?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, <strong>write your goals on paper</strong>, because the in-game feature is coming soon (but let’s be real—paper makes it more fun anyway).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>Big Goals &amp; Mini Goals:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>big goal</strong> is what you want by the end of the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>mini goal</strong> happens when someone sets the fastest lap (after the first five laps). Once the signal sounds, it’s go time—jump, clap, bust out a crazy dance move, snap a bizarre photo—the possibilities are endless!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Then—Race Begins!</strong> Hit Start, and let the chaos unfold. The winner gets crowned… and then <strong>the game suggests you LEAVE</strong>. No endless screen-staring—this is designed to keep the party rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/943b034b2613050e7a4c7f0c13e95408.avif?t=1754036686\" width=800 height=1097 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Players set up their vehicles before the race, choosing from <strong>5×5×5×5×5</strong> different customization options (more than 3000 total!), leading to completely unique behavior. If we had traditional tracks, the races would lose their high-speed excitement (or zoomed out.. so not suitable for parties). Instead, we use checkpoints, similar to real-life rally raids and drone racing, where the route isn’t fixed but depends on the capabilities of the vehicle. This approach makes the game more dynamic, unpredictable, and fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difference between free and full version of the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current difference is customization: free version has only 1 mode without race customization options (still playable in most cases, vehicles are customizable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In full version you can customize race (length, type - 'classic'/balanced and 'rusty engines'/fun), type of vehicles (5 different types right now vs 1 in free) + 5*5*5*5*5 'tuning options' (5x5x5x5x5 = 3125).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMPORTANT: <i>This is a party racing game, but without active driving. Each pilot configures their race vehicle once, but doesn't control it during the race. A party is about spending time with friends, not getting lost in a screen. Our game enhances the fun—it doesn’t steal it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IT'S EARLY ACCESS, SO THE GAME IS IN EARLY STAGE OF DEVELOPMENT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLEASE PLAY FREE VERSION (MAJOR PARTY RACING CORE) and pay only if you want to support the development. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five pilots, idle/lazy gameplay, a fresh take on the genre! Before playing, grab some paper cards and a marker, pen, or pencil—it’s part of the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/3c98f70f10394488ddf887cb240ea89f.poster.avif?t=1754036686\" width=700 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/3c98f70f10394488ddf887cb240ea89f.webm?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/3c98f70f10394488ddf887cb240ea89f.mp4?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How It Works:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a party-packed racing experience! You and your friends split into <strong>two squads</strong>—racers and support teams. But here's the twist: support teams aren’t locked to a specific driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Racers</strong> customize their vehicles and fine-tune their driving style. <br>🎲 <strong>Support teams</strong> strategize—who’s their pick, and what’s the next big vibe for the party. They place their <strong>big goal</strong> on the chosen driver—what happens if their pilot wins. Someone’s eyeing pizza, another’s calling for the jacuzzi, maybe a dance-off, or even a hilarious video challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/dab50cef737efc853ef3b8295b839c76.poster.avif?t=1754036686\" width=544 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/dab50cef737efc853ef3b8295b839c76.webm?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/dab50cef737efc853ef3b8295b839c76.mp4?t=1754036686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, <strong>write your goals on paper</strong>, because the in-game feature is coming soon (but let’s be real—paper makes it more fun anyway).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>Big Goals &amp; Mini Goals:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>big goal</strong> is what you want by the end of the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>mini goal</strong> happens when someone sets the fastest lap (after the first five laps). Once the signal sounds, it’s go time—jump, clap, bust out a crazy dance move, snap a bizarre photo—the possibilities are endless!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Then—Race Begins!</strong> Hit Start, and let the chaos unfold. The winner gets crowned… and then <strong>the game suggests you LEAVE</strong>. No endless screen-staring—this is designed to keep the party rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486460/extras/943b034b2613050e7a4c7f0c13e95408.avif?t=1754036686\" width=800 height=1097 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Players set up their vehicles before the race, choosing from <strong>5×5×5×5×5</strong> different customization options (more than 3000 total!), leading to completely unique behavior. If we had traditional tracks, the races would lose their high-speed excitement (or zoomed out.. so not suitable for parties). Instead, we use checkpoints, similar to real-life rally raids and drone racing, where the route isn’t fixed but depends on the capabilities of the vehicle. This approach makes the game more dynamic, unpredictable, and fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difference between free and full version of the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current difference is customization: free version has only 1 mode without race customization options (still playable in most cases, vehicles are customizable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In full version you can customize race (length, type - 'classic'/balanced and 'rusty engines'/fun), type of vehicles (5 different types right now vs 1 in free) + 5*5*5*5*5 'tuning options' (5x5x5x5x5 = 3125).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
